41637::$$$message_0319_0000_0000$$$::"Promo art #2.[lr]::
41638::$$$message_0319_0000_0001$$$::I'm curious about that tulip hat on the bottom right..."::
41639::$$$message_0319_0001_0000$$$::"You already know what it actually is.[br]Would you ever put that 'hat' on your head?"::
41640::$$$message_0319_0002_0000$$$::"Hard pass. I'd give it to someone who can wear it better."::

